## Additional Calculated Fields

### Risk Trend (for time-based analysis)
```sql
-- Add to views for trend analysis
WITH risk_history AS (
  SELECT 
    merchant_id,
    combined_risk,
    last_updated,
    LAG(combined_risk) OVER (PARTITION BY merchant_id ORDER BY last_updated) as prev_risk
  FROM `brand_risk_engine.aggregated_risk`
)
SELECT 
  *,
  CASE 
    WHEN combined_risk > prev_risk THEN 'INCREASING'
    WHEN combined_risk < prev_risk THEN 'DECREASING'
    ELSE 'STABLE'
  END as risk_trend
FROM risk_history
```

### Brand Impact Score
```sql
-- Calculated field for overall brand impact
CASE 
  WHEN risk_level = 'HIGH' THEN combined_risk * 3
  WHEN risk_level = 'MEDIUM' THEN combined_risk * 2
  ELSE combined_risk
END
```

